Quick view</span></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1 px-3 pb-3 pt-2.5 sm:gap-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:pb-4 sm:pt-3\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[0.875rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-[0.9375rem]\"><a class=\"rounded-xs transition-colors hover:text-primary\" href=\"/product/deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\"><span class=\"line-clamp-2 md:line-clamp-3\">Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board</span></a></h3><div class=\"mt-auto space-y-2 pt-2 sm:space-y-2.5 sm:pt-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[0.75rem] sm:text-body-sm text-muted\">From</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-baseline gap-1 whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"text-[1.1875rem] sm:text-price tabular font-medium text-ink\">₹2,580</span><span class=\"text-[0.75rem] sm:text-body-sm text-muted\">+ GST</span></span></span><a class=\"z-20 flex h-11 w-full min-w-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-primary/30 bg-primary-soft px-3 text-caption font-semibold text-primary-strong transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 sm:hidden\" href=\"/product/deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\">Select size</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add to cart: Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board, 3 x 4 ft\" class=\"z-20 hidden h-10 w-full min-w-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary px-3 text-caption font-semibold text-onprimary transition-colors hover:bg-primary-strong sm:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">Add to cart</span></button></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-surface py-10 lg:py-24\" aria-labelledby=\"benefits-heading\"><div class=\"pm-shell\"><header class=\"grid gap-3 sm:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,0.8fr)] lg:items-end lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h2 id=\"benefits-heading\" class=\"max-w-[24ch] font-display text-[1.375rem] font-extrabold leading-7 text-ink balance sm:text-h2 sm:leading-[1.15]\">Straightforward to choose, easy to order</h2></div><p class=\"line-clamp-2 max-w-[54ch] text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:line-clamp-none sm:text-[1.0625rem] lg:pb-1\">Plusmark Display System<!-- --> is an Ahmedabad manufacturer established in <!-- -->2015<!-- -->. These are the things the storefront can actually stand behind today — anything still being finalised is marked as such rather than guessed at.</p></header><ul class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 sm:mt-12 sm:gap-x-10 sm:gap-y-10 lg:mt-16 lg:gap-x-14 xl:grid-cols-4\"><li class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:items-center sm:gap-0 sm:text-center\"><span class=\"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary sm:size-12\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ruler size-5 text-onprimary sm:size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 12.5 2-2\"></path><path d=\"m11.5 9.5 2-2\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 6.5 2-2\"></path><path d=\"m17.5 15.5 2-2\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 sm:contents\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[0.8125rem] font-bold leading-snug text-ink sm:mt-4 sm:max-w-[30ch] sm:text-body\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Sizes &amp; series</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Sizes and series to choose from</span></h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-muted sm:hidden\">Every product lists its published sizes and the series it belongs to, so you can match the board to the wall before you order.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:items-center sm:gap-0 sm:text-center\"><span class=\"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary sm:size-12\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card size-5 text-onprimary sm:size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 sm:contents\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[0.8125rem] font-bold leading-snug text-ink sm:mt-4 sm:max-w-[30ch] sm:text-body\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Order online</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Order online, one board at a time</span></h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-muted sm:hidden\">Pick a size, add it to the cart and check out with your delivery details. There is no minimum order.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:items-center sm:gap-0 sm:text-center\"><span class=\"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary sm:size-12\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-5 text-onprimary sm:size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 sm:contents\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[0.8125rem] font-bold leading-snug text-ink sm:mt-4 sm:max-w-[30ch] sm:text-body\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Clear specs</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Clear product information</span></h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-muted sm:hidden\">Writing face, frame and corner are described on every product page, exactly as Plusmark publishes them.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:items-center sm:gap-0 sm:text-center\"><span class=\"flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary sm:size-12\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck size-5 text-onprimary sm:size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 sm:contents\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[0.8125rem] font-bold leading-snug text-ink sm:mt-4 sm:max-w-[30ch] sm:text-body\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Made in India</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Made in Ahmedabad, dispatched across India</span></h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-muted sm:hidden\">Boards are manufactured at the Narolgam works in Ahmedabad, Gujarat and dispatched to your pincode.</p></div></li></ul><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-8 gap-y-4 border-t border-line pt-6 sm:mt-14 sm:border-0 sm:pt-8\"><p class=\"max-w-[56ch] text-caption text-muted sm:text-body-sm\">Questions before you order? The Plusmark team answers by phone, email and WhatsApp.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-5 text-body-sm font-medium text-onprimary transition-colors hover:bg-primary-strong sm:h-12 sm:px-6\" href=\"/contact\">Contact support</a><a class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md border border-primary/25 px-5 text-body-sm font-medium text-brand transition-colors hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary-soft sm:h-12 sm:px-6\" href=\"/faq\">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-subtle py-10 lg:py-24\" aria-labelledby=\"reviews-heading\"><div class=\"pm-shell\"><header class=\"flex flex-col-reverse gap-4 pb-5 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-end sm:justify-between sm:gap-6 sm:pb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h2 id=\"reviews-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.375rem] font-extrabold leading-7 text-ink sm:text-h2 sm:leading-[1.15]\">What buyers say after the board arrives</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-rating\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star size-3.5 fill-current\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star size-3.5 fill-current\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.