-lasting and highly resistant to wear and tear\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":false,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":true,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},\\\"chalk\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-chalk-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"metallic-premium-chalk-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Metallic Premium Chalk Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"chalk-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":\\\"metallic-premium\\\",\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[\\\"chalk-boards-non-magnetic\\\"],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Aluminium anodized frame, heavy-duty\\\",\\\"corners\\\":\\\"Signature Dual-Tone corners - red cap over black connector\\\",\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"non-magnetic\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"chalk\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Schools, colleges, offices and institutional classrooms\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Metallic Premium Chalk Board: Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet · Aluminium anodized frame, heavy-duty. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Metallic Premium Chalk Board uses high-quality materials with rigid core construction, finished in heavy-duty aluminium framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners.\\\\n\\\\nIts Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet has enhanced scratch resistance and is non-reflective and glare-free, with clear visibility from all angles. It is built for intensive daily institutional use and is wall-mountable, easy to install.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Mat