door cover\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium frame\\\",\\\"corners\\\":null,\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"n/a\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"pin-up\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Offices, institutions, housing societies, hospitals and public areas\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Double Door): Transparent acrylic door cover · Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board is an acrylic door covered notice board with a double door design. Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing adds strength and a premium appearance, and the transparent acrylic cover protects notices from dust and handling.\\\\n\\\\nA secure double-door system keeps the display controlled. It is suited to offices, institutions, housing societies, hospitals and public areas.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Type — Acrylic door covered notice board, double door design\\\",\\\"Framing — Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing\\\",\\\"Cover — Transparent acrylic door cover protecting notices from dust and handling\\\",\\\"Locking — Secure double-door system for controlled notice display\\\",\\\"Application — Offices, institutions, housing societies, hospitals and public areas\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Double Door) - Deluxe Standard ADC Notice B