long-lasting for regular institutional use.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 2 x 3 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Material — Premium-grade strong materials\\\",\\\"Design — ABS Dual-Tone Corner Design for added strength\\\",\\\"Surface — Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet with enhanced scratch resistance; non-reflective and glare-free with clear visibility from all angles\\\",\\\"Durability — Reliable and long-lasting for regular institutional use\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[\\\"$21:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:props:asset\\\"],\\\"videoId\\\":\\\"plusmark/videos/eco-premium-chalk-board\\\",\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"eco-premium-chalk-board--2-x-3-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"eco-premium-chalk-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-EP-CHA-2X3FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2-x-3-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"2 x 3 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":91,\\\"heightCm\\\":61},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":1900,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"eco-premium-chalk-board--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"eco-premium-chalk-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-EP-CHA-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3100,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"eco-premium-chalk-board--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\