xe-standard-ceramic-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"white-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard\\\",\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[\\\"white-boards-ceramic\\\"],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Aluminium frame\\\",\\\"corners\\\":\\\"Electroplated Chrome Corners\\\",\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"ceramic\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"marker\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Institutional white board (marker) or chalk board use\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board: Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface · Aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board has a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface, available as a white board for marker writing or a chalk board for chalk writing. The hard, non-porous surface suits continuous writing and frequent cleaning, with consistent performance over a very long product life.\\\\n\\\\nIt is finished in an aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners. Where magnetic use is not required, the non-magnetic Eco Premium boards are a more economical alternative with similar writing performance.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Surface — Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel, in white board (marker) and chalk board options\\\",\\\"Product life — Designed for very long life under regular institutional use\\\",\\\"Performance — Hard, non-porou