Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Surface — High-quality natural cork suitable for repeated pin use\\\",\\\"Core — Soft and resilient base for smooth pin insertion and firm holding\\\",\\\"Performance — Frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\\\",\\\"Finish — Uniform cork texture with a neat and professional appearance\\\",\\\"Durability — Long-lasting performance for regular notice display\\\",\\\"Design options — Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/cork-notice-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Cork Notice Board - Notice Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cork-notice-board--standard-size\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"cork-notice-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-NOT-STANDA\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard-size\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Standard size\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3070,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cork-notice-board--made-to-order\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"cork-notice-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-NOT-MADETO\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"made-to-order\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Made to order\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3070,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null}],\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"gstRatePercent\\\":12,\\\"hsnCode\\\":null,\\\"minimumOrderQuantity\\\":1,\\\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\\\":10,\\\"specs\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"High-quality natural cork surface suitable for repeated pin use\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Core\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Soft and resilient base material designed specially for smooth pin insertion and firm holding\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Performance\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Allows frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Finish\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Uniform cork texture with a neat and professional appearance\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Durability\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Long-lasting surface performance for regular notice display use\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":true,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":true,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"white-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard\\\",\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[\\\"white-boards-magnetic\\\"],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"Resin coated writing surface (white and green options)\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Aluminium frame\\\",\\\"corners\\\":\\\"Electroplated Chrome Corners\\\",\\\"magnetic\\\":true,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"magnetic\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"marker\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Daily classroom or office writing with magnetic accessories\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board: Resin coated writing surface (white and green options) · Aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board has a resin-coated writing surface available in white and green options. It is suitable for standard magnetic accessories.\\\\n\\\\nThe aluminium frame uses Electroplated Chrome Corners, and the smooth surface suits daily classroom or office writing. Balanced construction keeps it dependable for regular use.\\\\n\\\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Surface — Resin coated writing surface in white and green options\\\",\\\"Magnetic use — Suitable for standard magnetic accessories\\\",\\\"Design — Aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners\\\",\\\"Finish — Smooth surface for daily classroom or office writing\\\",\\\"Build — Balanced construction for regular use\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board - Deluxe Standard Whiteboard by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":2000,\\\"height\\\":1600,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-WHI-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2580,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-WHI-4X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"4 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":122},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":3240,\\\"comp