:\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Regular indoor notice display\",\"blurb\":\"Eco ADC Notice Board (Single Door): Transparent acrylic door cover · Lightweight aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Eco ADC Notice Board is an acrylic door covered notice board with a single door. Lightweight aluminium framing keeps it economical and practical, while the transparent acrylic cover protects notices from dust and handling.\\n\\nA single-door locking system keeps the display safe and controlled, with smooth door operation and clear visibility of notices. The clean, simple finish suits regular indoor applications.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Type — Acrylic door covered notice board, single door design\",\"Framing — Lightweight aluminium framing for economical and practical use\",\"Cover — Transparent acrylic door cover protecting notices from dust and handling\",\"Locking — Single-door locking system for safe and controlled display\",\"Performance — Smooth door operation with clear visibility of notices\",\"Finish — Clean and simple finish for regular indoor applications\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/eco-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"alt\":\"Eco ADC Notice Board (Single Door) - Eco Regular ADC Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-adc-notice-board-single-door--1-x-1-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"s