end on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Visibility — Transparent front folders for easy document viewing\",\"Display — Ideal for charts, reports, SOPs and production data\",\"Access — Papers can be inserted and replaced quickly\",\"Custom layout — Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\",\"Frame — Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\"],\"customisation\":\"Folder size and quantity are made to customer requirement.\",\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"alt\":\"Acrylic Folder Display Board - Specialty Display Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board--standard-size\",\"productId\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-SPE-STANDA\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"standard-size\",\"label\":\"Standard size\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2920,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board--made-to-order\",\"productId\":\"acrylic-folder-display-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-SPE-MADETO\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"made-to-order\",\"label\":\"Made to order\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2920,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null}],\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"gstRatePercent\":12,\"hsnCode\":null,\"minimumOrderQuantity\":1,\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\":10,\"specs\":[{\"label\":\"Folders\",\"value\":\"Transparent front folders\"},{\"label\":\"Layout\",\"value\":\"Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\"},{\"label\":\"Frame\",\"value\":\"Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":true,\"published\":true,\"featured\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"slug\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"name\":\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door)\",\"categoryId\":\"acrylic-door-cover-notice-boards\",\"seriesId\":\"deluxe-standard\",\"subcategoryIds\":[],\"surface\":\"High gloss melamine writing surface\",\"frame\":\"Deluxe anodized aluminium frame\",\"corners\":\"Electroplated chrome corners\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Lockable notice boards with transparent acrylic door covers that protect notices from dust and handling.\",\"blurb\":\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door): High gloss melamine writing surface · Deluxe anodized aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Deluxe 45 mm Acrylic Door Cover (ADC) Notice Board (Single Door) is a notice board with a single-door acrylic cover. Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing provides strength, stability and long-term durability. The transparent acrylic door cover protects displayed notices from dust, moisture and handling, with a secure single-door locking system, smooth door operation and clear visibility of notices.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — High gloss melamine writing surface\",\"Frame — Deluxe anodized aluminium frame\",\"Corners — Electroplated chrome corners\",\"Non-magnetic face\",\"Sizes made — 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft\",\"Custom sizes made to order\",\"Pan-India dispatch from Ahmedabad\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/de