ar visibility from all angles. It suits home classrooms, tuition classes and small institutions, and is made for light, economical use.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Cost-effective, regular materials\",\"Design — Lightweight frame with standard plastic corners\",\"Surface — Chalk Grade HPL Sheet; non-reflective, glare-free, with clear visibility from all angles\",\"Durability — Suitable for light and economical use\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/eco-regular-chalk-board\",\"alt\":\"Eco Regular Chalk Board - Eco Regular Chalkboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board--1-x-1-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-CHA-1X1FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"1-x-1-ft\",\"label\":\"1 x 1 ft\",\"widthCm\":30,\"heightCm\":30},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board--2-x-2-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-CHA-2X2FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"2-x-2-ft\",\"label\":\"2 x 2 ft\",\"widthCm\":61,\"heightCm\":61},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":970,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board--2-x-3-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-chalk-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-CHA-2X3FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"2-x-3-ft\",\"label\":\"2 x 3 ft\",\"widthCm\":91,\"h